  {
   "type": "cols",
   "layout": "33-66",
   "columns": [
    [
     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "<h1> Options </h1>",
      "body": "<p>Compare the options at a glance, or contact us: We will be happy to advise you on the selection of your model and the innovative variety of options.</p>",
      "images": [],
      "videos": [],
      "pos": "text",
      "cols": 1,
      "valign": "top",
      "ftype": "text",
      "id": "c1253",
      "bg": "",
      "space": {
       "before": "default",
       "after": "default"
      }
     }
    ],
    [
     {
      "type": "accordion",
      "header": "",
      "items": [
       {
        "title": "Fume extraction",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>The fume extraction system reliably removes fumes from the operator's working area. The established and patented fume extraction system above the induction coil has been extended to include an integrated extraction system inside the coil housing. The fumes are therefore extracted directly where they are produced. The filter unit has a safe place in the under-table unit.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/b/f/csm_option_rauchgasabsaugung_01_fba2121e7e.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 792,
            "h": 457
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c1266",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Air cooling »zStream«",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>With ZOLLER’s »zStream« air cooling, you get maximum flexibility and protection when cooling your shrink fit holders, regardless of their contour or diameter. In addition, your shrink-clamping tools are cooled consistently and safely across their entire length – without the risk of being damaged. »zStream« is also ideally suited for cooling tools that have been set down.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/3/b/csm_option_zstream_01_f2bb28c1fa.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 792,
            "h": 457
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c1264",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Length adjustment »eQset«",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>The integrated length adjustment system is used to set the overall length or projection length and for tool replacement. The pneumatically activated quick adjustment and fine adjustment by handwheel enable fast, ergonomic and precise positioning of the probe head to the desired height.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/b/b/csm_option_eqset_01_b4fe640b93.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 792,
            "h": 457
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c1262",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Scan function incl. hand scanner",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>The »pilot« software scan function in combination with the hand scanner enables reliable selection of the appropriate shrink fit parameter by scanning the holder number on the shrink fit holder. Regardless of the manufacturer, all shrink fit toolholders with DataMatrix code (e.g. ZOLLER »idLabel«, ZOLLER »idChip«) are supported.</p> <p>In the »pilot« software, each heating process can be counted for each shrink fit chuck. In addition, a warning and wear limit can be stored in relation to the permitted heating processes.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/6/f/csm_option_zidcode_01_45e04f3e38.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 792,
            "h": 457
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c1260",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Set-up table for »powerShrink 400«",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>As an alternative to installation on a workbench, the »powerShrink 300« and »powerShrink 400« can be positioned on a set-up table with ergonomically optimal working height. This provides a tidy place for the cooler and fume extraction unit. The table is optionally available with sturdy rollers and an ergonomic handle to allow variable positioning.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/9/e/csm_option_tisch_01_b71faa1d03.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 792,
            "h": 502
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c1256",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Configurations for »powerShrink 400 ❘ 11«",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p><strong>There are 3 basic configurations for the induction coils to choose from:</strong></p> <p>1. Combination of any 14 kVA induction coil with quick-change interface, changing the induction coil from one induction coil axis to the other depending on the shrink chuck length</p> <p>2. Combination of any 2 14 kVA induction coils without »shrinkbyLight« and without quick-change interface</p> <p>3. Combination of any 14 kVA induction coil with a 22 kVA induction coil with quick-change interface</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/4/c/csm_Konfiguration_powershrink400_11_cf735e33c0.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 379
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c4227",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       }
      ],
      "ftype": "accordion",
      "id": "c1254",
      "bg": "",
      "space": {
       "before": "default",
       "after": "default"
      }
     }
    ]
