      }
     }
    ],
    [
     {
      "type": "accordion",
      "header": "",
      "items": [
       {
        "title": "Holder pot",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Your »powerShrink« comes with a holder pot as standard. Additional pots can be ordered for parallel heating and cooling. The work surface is perfectly matched to the holder pot and ensures convenient and quiet movement.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/f/a/csm_zubehoer_aufnahmetopf_01_aba9b1b932.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 792,
            "h": 370
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c1283",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Mounting rings",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>The different mounting rings allow flexible changeover between different mounting interfaces. For all common tool holder types and sizes up to SK 50, HSK 100 and PSC 10.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/f/c/csm_zubehoer_aufnahmeringe_151beeeb0b.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 792,
            "h": 370
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c1281",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Special cooling adapter",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Cooling adapter for special shrink fit chuck shapes and sizes (e.g. also for D3 mm to D5 mm). Suitable for cooling bells D14 mm to D16 mm or D25 mm to D32 mm.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/9/7/csm_zubehoer_sonderkuehladapter_01_556e49b624.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 792,
            "h": 370
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c1279",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Shelves",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p><strong>Storage board for mounting rings and special cooling adapters </strong><br/>The storage board provides space for storing four mounting rings and six special cooling adapters size I or three special cooling adapters size I and size II.</p> <p><strong>Tool tray</strong><br/>For storing shank tools at the shrinking workstation. The position of the tray can be freely selected by the operator.</p> <p><strong>Shelf</strong> <strong>for cleaning brushes</strong><br/>A shelf with all brush diameters is available for storing cleaning brushes, which can be attached to the device in any position using magnets. The brushes for cleaning the mounting hole of shrink fit chucks are also available from ZOLLER - for shank diameters D3 mm to D32 mm, optionally made of brass or plastic.</p> <p><strong>Split shielding discs with tray</strong><br/>An optional set of shielding discs (5 pieces) in a split design including the corresponding disc tray can be ordered for shrink-fitting offset tools.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c1277",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Coil operating handle",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>For optimum user-friendliness, the operating handle, which is fitted on the left as standard, can be fitted on the right or on both sides. Each operating handle is equipped with two function buttons - for moving the coil and activating the heating process.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/a/6/csm_zubehoer_spulengriff_01_65f1a47f89.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 792,
            "h": 370
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c1275",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Shrink-out device »toolEx«",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>»toolEx« helps you to remove tools from the shrink fit chuck that cannot be pulled out by hand or with pliers, such as broken tools. The set includes a holder and six ejector rods.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/3/c/csm_zubehoer_toolex_01_a94afb0d47.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 792,
            "h": 370
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c1273",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Length adjustment »liteSet«",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Use »liteSet« to set the projection length of the tool to be shrunk. The maximum projection length is 150 mm. The set contains four clamping prisms for shank diameters D3 mm to D32 mm.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/6/6/csm_zubehoer_liteset_01_21e2064a9b.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 792,
            "h": 370
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c1271",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       }
      ],
      "ftype": "accordion",
      "id": "c1269",
